<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Order of the Lion & Sun Bell</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --sand: #c79a69;
      --sand-light: #e4c59c;
      --stone: #7a624d;
      --gold: #d8b16a;
      --ember: #ff5b2e;
      --ember-bright: #ffcf6b;
      --wine: #3b1012;
      --night: #090714;
      --night-2: #120d24;
      --text: #f4e6c8;
      --shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 10%, rgba(255,255,255,0.08), transparent 18%),
        linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(8,7,20,0.95) 0%, rgba(18,13,36,0.9) 22%, rgba(84,43,27,0.25) 38%, rgba(199,154,105,0.12) 52%, rgba(59,16,18,0.7) 100%),
        linear-gradient(to bottom, #05040a, #130d25 30%, #2a1520 60%, #140a0a 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(2px 2px at 8% 16%, rgba(255,255,255,0.9), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 22% 10%, rgba(255,255,255,0.55), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(2px 2px at 36% 21%, rgba(255,255,255,0.85), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 44% 13%, rgba(255,255,255,0.45), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(2px 2px at 58% 8%, rgba(255,255,255,0.8), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 74% 16%, rgba(255,255,255,0.5), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(2px 2px at 87% 12%, rgba(255,255,255,0.8), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 93% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.45), transparent 60%);
      opacity: 0.8;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .sky-glow {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 5%, rgba(116, 111, 224, 0.28), transparent 25%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 15%, rgba(84, 110, 224, 0.12), transparent 18%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 18%, rgba(84, 110, 224, 0.12), transparent 18%);
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 5rem 1.5rem 7rem;
      isolation: isolate;
    }

    .hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: auto 0 0 0;
      height: 60%;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 70%, rgba(199,154,105,0.45), transparent 26%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 42% 82%, rgba(199,154,105,0.55), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 78% 74%, rgba(199,154,105,0.42), transparent 27%),
        linear-gradient(to top, rgba(78,42,19,0.6), transparent 65%);
      z-index: -1;
      filter: blur(4px);
    }

    .temple-silhouette {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 20% 0 auto 0;
      height: 45vh;
      background:
        linear-gradient(to top, rgba(14, 12, 16, 0.9), rgba(14, 12, 16, 0.15)),
        polygon(0 100%);
      z-index: -1;
      opacity: 0.45;
      pointer-events: none;
      clip-path: polygon(
        0% 100%, 0% 80%, 6% 77%, 10% 60%, 14% 61%, 16% 44%, 22% 44%, 24% 65%, 29% 63%,
        31% 35%, 36% 35%, 38% 57%, 44% 58%, 46% 27%, 52% 28%, 54% 60%, 61% 60%, 64% 42%,
        69% 44%, 72% 64%, 78% 62%, 82% 50%, 86% 51%, 89% 72%, 93% 71%, 100% 80%, 100% 100%
      );
    }

    .content {
      width: min(980px, 100%);
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .crest {
      margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
      width: min(680px, 100%);
      padding: 1rem 1rem 0.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(216, 177, 106, 0.45);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(216, 177, 106, 0.25);
      position: relative;
    }

    .crest::before,
    .crest::after {
      content: "✦";
      position: absolute;
      top: -0.85rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--gold);
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .crest::before { left: 1rem; }
    .crest::after { right: 1rem; }

    .eyebrow {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.38rem;
      color: var(--sand-light);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.95rem;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7vw, 5.8rem);
      line-height: 0.95;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.05rem;
      color: #f2dfbc;
      text-shadow:
        0 0 18px rgba(216, 177, 106, 0.16),
        0 8px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
    }

    h1 .small {
      display: block;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.45rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    }

    .subtitle {
      width: min(720px, 100%);
      margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: rgba(244, 230, 200, 0.9);
      text-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }

    .motto {
      margin-top: 1.75rem;
      color: var(--sand-light);
      font-style: italic;
      letter-spacing: 0.08rem;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }

    .cta-row {
      margin-top: 2.25rem;
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text);
      padding: 0.95rem 1.4rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(216, 177, 106, 0.45);
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(216,177,106,0.16), rgba(59,16,18,0.2));
      box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      border-radius: 999px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      transition: transform 220ms ease, background 220ms ease, border-color 220ms ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(216,177,106,0.28), rgba(59,16,18,0.32));
      border-color: rgba(255, 207, 107, 0.72);
    }

    .btn.secondary {
      background: rgba(9, 7, 20, 0.45);
    }



    .section {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .panel {
      width: min(1100px, 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(19, 13, 27, 0.78), rgba(43, 23, 18, 0.72));
      border: 1px solid rgba(216, 177, 106, 0.22);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.35), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    }

    .panel h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
      color: #f2dfbc;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .panel p.lead {
      text-align: center;
      color: rgba(244,230,200,0.84);
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .card {
      padding: 1.4rem;
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(216,177,106,0.08), rgba(9,7,20,0.22));
      border: 1px solid rgba(216,177,106,0.15);
      min-height: 210px;
    }

    .card .sigil {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: #f3e0bb;
    }

    .card p {
      color: rgba(244,230,200,0.82);
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
    }

    .footer {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem;
      text-align: center;
      color: rgba(244,230,200,0.7);
      letter-spacing: 0.08rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    @keyframes sway {
      0% { transform: translateX(-2px) scaleY(1) rotate(-2deg); }
      50% { transform: translateX(2px) scaleY(1.05) rotate(1deg); }
      100% { transform: translateX(-1px) scaleY(0.97) rotate(2deg); }
    }

    @keyframes rise {
      0% {
        transform: translate(-4px, 0) scale(0.6);
        opacity: 0;
      }
      10% { opacity: 1; }
      100% {
        transform: translate(22px, -170px) scale(0.1);
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .flame-pillar {
        width: 120px;
        height: 250px;
        opacity: 0.92;
      }

      .altar {
        width: 84px;
        height: 62px;
      }

      .flame-core,
      .flame-mid,
      .flame-outer {
        bottom: 48px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .hero {
        padding-top: 6.5rem;
      }

      .subtitle {
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      .eyebrow,
      h1 .small {
        letter-spacing: 0.24rem;
      }

      .flame-pillar {
        width: 88px;
        height: 220px;
      }

      .panel {
        padding: 1.3rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="sky-glow"></div>
  <div class="temple-silhouette"></div>



  <header class="hero" id="top">
    <div class="content">
      <div class="crest">
        <div class="eyebrow">Ancient Temple • Desert Sky • Hidden Order</div>
        <h1>
          <span class="small">The Order of the</span>
          Lion &amp; Sun Bell
        </h1>
      </div>

      <p class="subtitle">
        Beneath the star-woven firmament and among the buried sanctuaries of sand,
        the Heralds of the Lion guard the old wisdom, the sacred bell, and the fire that does not die.
      </p>

      <p class="motto">“From the temple of memory, the flame endures.”</p>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn" href="#order">Enter the Order</a>
        <a class="btn secondary" href="#heralds">The Heralds</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section" id="order">
    <div class="panel">
      <h2>The Hidden Order</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        A secret society shaped in the image of ancient courts, desert kingdoms, temple fires, and celestial omens.
        This design leans into a Persian-inspired atmosphere with dunes, sacred stone, deep crimson flame, and a night sky alive with stars.
      </p>

      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="sigil">☉</div>
          <h3>Order Name</h3>
          <p>
            <strong>Full title:</strong> Order of the Heralds of the Lion and Sun Bell.<br><br>
            <strong>Short form:</strong> Order of Lions Bell.<br><br>
            <strong>Members:</strong> Heralds of the Lion.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card" id="heralds">
          <div class="sigil">🜂</div>
          <h3>Sacred Fire</h3>
          <p>
            Twin flames rise on either side like the burning guardians of a holy ark—ceremonial, watchful, and eternal.
            They frame the page as living altars at the threshold of the order.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="sigil">✦</div>
          <h3>Temple Atmosphere</h3>
          <p>
            Buried sanctuaries, carved stone silhouettes, drifting dunes, and a celestial vault above.
            The whole landing page is meant to feel like an ancient initiation chamber uncovered in the desert at night.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="footer">
    Order of the Lion &amp; Sun Bell • Heralds of the Lion • Under the stars, beyond the dunes
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
